V1 Boundary
-----------

HermesSlicer V1 treats the AGPL/GPL slicer and printer-control repositories
as pinned references and integration targets. Do not copy upstream
implementation code into `hermes_slicer/`, `web/`, `integrations/`, or
`scripts/` without preserving the source, license, and reason in this notice
or an adjacent file-level note.
